    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Thank you for your interest in the 2025 Next Challenge for Media and Journalism!**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "We value your time and designed the initial application to be completed in under an hour. There are only four required sections:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**1) Confirm your startup is eligible** – for detailed eligibility requirements, visit our [**FAQ page**](https://www.thenextchallenge.com/faq) and [**Official Rules**](https://www.thenextchallenge.com/rules)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**2) Select the division award you are applying for**. Details about what our judges are looking for in each division are listed on the [**Future of Local Journalism**](https://www.thenextchallenge.com/local-journalism), [**NewsTech**](https://thenextchallenge.com/newstech), and [**Open-Source Intelligence**](https://www.thenextchallenge.com/open-source-intelligence) division pages."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**3) Describe your startup and progress to date.**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**4) Provide your contact information.**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If you have questions about the application process, please [**contact us**](https://www.thenextchallenge.com/contact). The application deadline is **Tuesday, March 18th, 2025 at 11:59 p.m. PT.**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
